-17do188"><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiTab-root MuiTab-textColorInherit Mui-selected mui-1clht11" tabindex="0" role="tab" aria-selected="true" href="/community" idx="0" id="tab-0" aria-controls="tab-0">Home<span class="MuiTabs-indicator mui-1yjp74j"></span></a><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiTab-root MuiTab-textColorInherit mui-1clht11" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="false" href="/trending" idx="2" id="tab-2" aria-controls="tab-2">Trending</a><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiTab-root MuiTab-textColorInherit mui-1clht11" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="false" href="/groups" idx="5" id="tab-5" aria-controls="tab-5">Discover</a></div></div></div><main class="marginAboveMainContentProvider mui-76zzj0"><div class="mobileMarginProvider"><h1>Welcome to the community</h1><p class="bodyText spacer">To get started, here are some posts from our most popular topics: <a href="/groups/topic/25000192/pregnancy-groups">pregnancy</a>, <a href="/groups/topic/25001435/baby-toddler-groups">babies</a>, and <a href="/groups/topic/25000191/getting-pregnant-groups">getting pregnant</a>. You can also <a href="/groups">discover more</a> topics in all of our groups.</p><div class="mui-1g6pn2m"><div class="outerWrapper"><h2>Popular groups</h2><div class="scrollContainer indiana-scroll-container"><div class="column"><a class="mui-1d2307m" href="/g25001383/expecting-a-baby-?regPopup=1"><div class="content"><img alt="Group Image" src="https://imageserve.babycenter.com/16/000/089/irhWYHys2QefeBhdEKZDZwKKA91phahn_med_sq.jpg" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy" class="hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2"/><div class="textItems"><div class="title">Expecting a baby </div><div class="details"><div class="memberCount"><span>32.3k</span> <!-- -->members</div><div class="timeStamp">an hour ago</div></div><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary whiteBtn mui-x5juai" tabindex="0" type="button">Join group</button></div></div></a><a class="mui-1d2307m" href="/g25001381/getting-pregnant?regPopup=1"><div class="content"><img alt="Group Image" src="https://imageserve.babycenter.com/27/000/470/k8WUD0QWQTrrdHNIkzaG13JHWghW91ox_med_sq.jpg" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy" class="hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2"/><div class="textItems"><div class="title">Getting pregnant</div><div class="details"><div class="memberCount"><span>16.4k</span> <!-- -->members</div><div class="timeStamp"><span>6</span> <!-- -->hours ago</div></div><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary whiteBtn mui-x5juai" tabindex="0" type="button">Join group</button></div></div></a></div><div class="column"><a class="mui-1d2307m" href="/g25001451/baby-names-?regPopup=1"><div class="content"><img alt="Group Image" src="http://imageserve.babycenter.com/6/000/089/E5aAut7VIiobDbB5XwyzkhEXxRYFRXv9_med_sq.jpg" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy" class="hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2"/><div class="textItems"><div class="title">Baby names </div><div class="details"><div class="memberCount"><span>24.4k</span> <!-- -->members</div><div class="timeStamp"><span>9</span> <!-- -->hours ago</div></div><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary whiteBtn mui-x5juai" tabindex="0" type="button">Join group</button></div></div></a><a class="mui-1d2307m" href="/g25001477/mums-and-dads-chat-?regPopup=1"><div class="content"><img alt="Group Image" src="https://imageserve.babycenter.com/8/000/089/OVDMVTq9GUa7m7q4q1h5zQmBK5LunOPb_med_sq.jpg" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy" class="hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2"/><div class="textItems"><div class="title">Mums and dads chat </div><div class="details"><div class="memberCount"><span>10k</span> <!-- -->members</div><div class="timeStamp">08-09-26</div></div><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary whiteBtn mui-x5juai" tabindex="0" type="button">Join group</button></div></div></a></div><div class="column"><a class="mui-1d2307m" href="/g25008253/debates-and-discussions?regPopup=1"><div class="content"><img alt="Group Image" src="https://imageserve.babycenter.com/4/000/276/LtMcmGzEbBKqcSOWDpUzETwG0ZuA89ow_med_sq.jpg" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy" class="hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2"/><div class="textItems"><div class="title">Debates and Discussions</div><div class="details"><div class="memberCount"><span>7.1k</span> <!-- -->members</div><div class="timeStamp">20-10-26</div></div><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary whiteBtn mui-x5juai" tabindex="0" type="button">Join group</button></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><section class="mui-i7uzrb"><h2>Posts about pregnancy</h2><ul class="postList unstyledLinks communityText mui-1sh4vf"><li id="post-5575421" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001451/baby-names-">Baby names </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575421/baby-names">Baby Names</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-a7usph" size="20" aria-hidden="true">a</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By AlchemyOfSouls </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">My partner is from NZ and we’re wanting a Māori name for baby. Our issue is I can’t do the R rolling 😭 his mum just calls him boy instead of by his name so we thought it would be funny I could just call baby a nickname or boy/girl haha but I guess I’m just wanting to know of any beautiful Māori nam</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">9 hours ago </div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>0</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575418" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001383/expecting-a-baby-">Expecting a baby </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575418/childcare">Childcare</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-tm69gb" size="20" aria-hidden="true">m</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By MrsSessy </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">I'm a full-time Early Childhood Educator and working in the baby room. I just found out I am pregnant and symptoms are really bad. Anyone else working in childcare and can give me tips? </div><div class="timestamp finePrint">23-10-26 </div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>0</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575414" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001383/expecting-a-baby-">Expecting a baby </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575414/low-heart-beat-dating-scan">Low heart beat - dating scan</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true">j</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Jellybaby </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">I just went in for my dating scan at 7 weeks 4 days but know I ovulated day 18 so would have expected to measure about 7 weeks. Baby was measuring around 6 weeks 2 days to 5 days (average 6 weeks 4 days) and had a lower heart rate of 102. Any success stories where baby has had a lower heart rate and</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">23-10-26 by Jellybaby</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>2</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575413" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001383/expecting-a-baby-">Expecting a baby </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575413/personal-hospital-gown-yay-or-nay">Personal hospital gown, yay or nay?</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-nkvp61" size="20" aria-hidden="true">c</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Clg </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Hey y'all just looking for more opinions to add to my weigh/measuring for this topic!

Thoughts on having your own hospital-friendly gown for birthing?

On one hand, I'm AuDHD and having a MyThing that I know is a texture and comfort I like may be helpful to me. And some hospital gowns are less than</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">an hour ago by JJ33</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>5</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575403" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001383/expecting-a-baby-">Expecting a baby </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575403/genetic-testing">Genetic testing </a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true">j</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Jellybaby </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Has anyone got the beacon expanded carrier screening done from sonic? How long did it take to get results?</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">23-10-26 by BrianConnie</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>1</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="adUnitWrapper"><div class="greyAdBox mui-1qwcnd7"><div class="advertisementLabel grey">Advertisement | page continues below</div><div class="adSlotContainer grey"><ad-container id="medRectMobWrapper" style="display:block"><div id="medRectMob" class="adBox" style="text-align:center"></div></ad-container></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575396" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001383/expecting-a-baby-">Expecting a baby </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575396/does-anyone-know-much-about-hcg-levels-at-7-weeks">Does anyone know much about HCG levels at 7 weeks</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="mui-nkvp61" size="20" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://imageserve.babycenter.com/18/000/079/had0tqadKURm1n8rbBT88ymcic2rmDEs_med_sq.jpg" alt="member avatar" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"/></div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Tinkles101 </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">I had 3 days of spotting last week, had an ultrasound and was measuring correctly and saw heart beat. Doctor still said to check HCG levels at 7+1 week they were 70,000 and 2 days later 7+3 had only risen to 77,000 iv read that at this stage levels aren’t expected to double but very concerned at suc</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">20-10-26 </div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>0</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575392" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001383/expecting-a-baby-">Expecting a baby </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575392/sga-induction">SGA Induction </a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true">b</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By BabyJourney </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Has anyone had an SGA baby and turned down a recommended induction? Baby is measuring below 10th percentile but no additional problems have been found. Suspected to be just constitutionally small. Dr still recommending induction at 38-39 weeks but I really don’t want to be induced. Has anyone had an</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">20-10-26 </div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>0</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575382" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001383/expecting-a-baby-">Expecting a baby </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575382/slow-hcg-rise-success-stories">Slow HCG rise success stories</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xpclmf" size="20" aria-hidden="true">s</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Sunrisetwo </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Hello. I guess I'm looking for some false hope haha, before I accept that my pregnancy isn't going to work out. 
17 days post ovulation HCG was 59. About 50 hours later it is only 76, so a 27% increase I think in about two days.
That tells me I'm going to miscarriage, I guess. 

But give me your suc</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">19-10-26 </div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>0</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li></ul><div class="seeMoreWrapper"><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary whiteBtn mui-x5juai" tabindex="0" href="/groups/topic/25000192/pregnancy">See more</a></div></section><section class="mui-i7uzrb"><h2>Posts about babies</h2><ul class="postList unstyledLinks communityText mui-1sh4vf"><li id="post-5574660" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001471/starting-solids">Starting solids</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5574660/would-you-like-to-be-a-group-owner-here">Would you like to be a Group Owner here?</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://static.babycenter.com/user/yqi7vwLTJiDTjDNh/075714d5-881f-4431-bbf1-696247826724_w80.jpg" alt="member avatar" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"/></div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By JaneStaff </span></