      https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-2428863c-902f-49ed-abba-fe9f56e0561f_w1600.jpg 1600w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-2428863c-902f-49ed-abba-fe9f56e0561f 2000w" loading="lazy" class="image hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2" data-next-fallback-onerror="fallback-srcset"/></picture></div><div><picture class="hiddenUntilLoaded mui-1dhrdme"><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-6b86a5f0-e718-47d8-8f99-31b5951f495f_h230.webp 600w,https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-6b86a5f0-e718-47d8-8f99-31b5951f495f_h350.webp 2000w"/><img alt="Comment Image" src="https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-6b86a5f0-e718-47d8-8f99-31b5951f495f" srcSet="
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-6b86a5f0-e718-47d8-8f99-31b5951f495f_w250.jpg 250w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-6b86a5f0-e718-47d8-8f99-31b5951f495f_w600.jpg 600w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-6b86a5f0-e718-47d8-8f99-31b5951f495f_w1000.jpg 1000w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-6b86a5f0-e718-47d8-8f99-31b5951f495f_w1600.jpg 1600w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/kz1nXDdXyB5LtWgi/au-6b86a5f0-e718-47d8-8f99-31b5951f495f 2000w" loading="lazy" class="image hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2" data-next-fallback-onerror="fallback-srcset"/></picture></div></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Im on cycle day 10 and woke up with period like cramps and streaky blood (bright red) with clear discharge. My period started 10 days ago. A heavy normal period and finished cd 6. Yesterday i felt some sharp pain in ovaries but wasnt anything worrying. today i thought to take a test since chatgpt sa</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">23-10-26 </div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>0</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575410" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001381/getting-pregnant">Getting pregnant</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575410/anyone-else-trying-for-a-summer-2027-baby">Anyone else trying for a summer 2027 baby?  </a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="mui-1xpclmf" size="20" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://static.babycenter.com/user/u7SukKL1bkJI1MO2/au-ee54e6a9-2f23-444d-afb6-401d04d07cd6_w80.jpg" alt="member avatar" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"/></div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By sunnysideup </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Planning to start trying next month and getting excited! Anyone else in the same boat? ☀️</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">22-10-26 </div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>0</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575409" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25002643/am-i-pregnant">Am I pregnant?</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575409/please-help-11-days-of-spotting">Please help 11 days of spotting. </a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-nkvp61" size="20" aria-hidden="true">c</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By crazycatlady8481 </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">On the 29th my partner n i did the deed , since the 13th of this month ( October), I have been having redish/pinkish blood only when i wipe on n off.. I have taken pregnancy test the home strips, clear blue ect but its all negative. Could i be to early to test, and could there be a chance im pregnan</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">22-10-26 </div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>0</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575385" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001443/assisted-conception-">Assisted Conception </a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575385/26-embryos-failed-to-thaw-how-concerned-should-i-be">2/6 embryos failed to thaw, how concerned should I be? </a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true">j</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Jeanieinabottle </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Hi lovely people,

Just looking for a bit of comparison/experience/wisdom...

We had our fourth transfer today, the original embryo failed to thaw so we transferred the next one ( lower grade )

So far we have had

5AA - failed to thaw
5AA - live birth (so lucky I know)
4AB - MMC 8 weeks
4bb - chemi</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">12 hours ago by AnitaP</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>6</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-5575361" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/g25001381/getting-pregnant">Getting pregnant</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/thread/5575361/2ww-november-1st15th">2WW: November 1st-15th</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://static.babycenter.com/user/yqi7vwLTJiDTjDNh/075714d5-881f-4431-bbf1-696247826724_w80.jpg" alt="member avatar" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"/></div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By JaneStaff </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Join the group that matches the day you expect your period to start 😊

